    "question": {
      ":question/id": "be3c48ba-a29a-50d6-8a03-711e9269b055",
      ":question/problem": "Calculate $A-(B-C)$, where\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$C=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -5 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$A-(B-C)=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Performing the operations on each corresponding entry, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(B-C) & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}-(\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -5 \\\\ -2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-1-(-1) & -2-(-5) \\\\ -2-(-2) & -1-(-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3-0 & -2-3 \\\\ -3-0 & 3-0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -5 \\\\ -3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
